  steps:["Fry any meat in the oil until browned. Add kimchi and cook 3 minutes until it softens and smells toasty.","Add gochujang, kimchi juice and soy sauce; stir 30 seconds.","Add the rice and butter; toss 4 minutes until steaming hot and evenly red.","Fry the eggs separately; serve on top, finished with sesame oil."],
